    <bpmn:process id="W_W5434" name="W5434. OT Cyber Supply-Chain &amp; SBOM Risk Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New connected-device procurement (W5421); vendor acquisition/EOL announcement; supply-chain incident
Frequency: Per device model; continuous monitoring
Volume: ~25,000–40,000 OT endpoints across ~10–20 device classes and ~50–150 vendors
Owner: OT Security Lead
Participants: VS-161 TPRM, Procurement (VS-34/VS-03), VS-99 ITAM, channel owners
Source: workflow W5434 — OT Cyber Supply-Chain &amp; SBOM Risk Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5434_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5434_Lane1" name="OT Security Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5434_Lane2" name="OT Security Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5434_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5434_Start4" name="New connected-device procurement (W5421); vendor acquisition/EOL announcement…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5434_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5434_Task5" name="Require a software bill of materials (SBOM) and firmware/support-lifecycle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Require a software bill of materials (SBOM) and firmware/support-lifecycle commitment from every OT device vendor at procurement (W5421).
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5434_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5434_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5434_Task6" name="Maintain the OT SBOM repository and map disclosed component vulnerabilities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the OT SBOM repository and map disclosed component vulnerabilities (e.g., a vulnerable openssl/log4j equivalent in a controller firmware) to BuildRight devices.
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5434_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5434_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5434_Task7" name="Assess fourth-party risk — a sub-component or cloud dependency inside a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Assess fourth-party risk — a sub-component or cloud dependency inside a BMS/SCADA/locker/EV controller that itself has a risky supplier; concentrate with VS-161.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5434_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5434_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5434_Task8" name="Monitor vendor lifecycle (acquisition, end-of-support, insolvency) and trigger…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Monitor vendor lifecycle (acquisition, end-of-support, insolvency) and trigger replacement (VS-99/W5423) before a device class goes unpatched.
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5434_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5434_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5434_Task9" name="Coordinate OT supply-chain risk into enterprise TPRM reporting (VS-161) and the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Coordinate OT supply-chain risk into enterprise TPRM reporting (VS-161) and the risk register (W5424).
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5434_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5434_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5434_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5434_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5434_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-802 (ensure controlled execution — OT Compliance, Third-Party Access &amp; Cyber Resilience Analytics (PA-190.3).) | - operational: TPRM/vendor risk; SBOM/inventory; operational: SBOM required before any new OT device model is approved.
Owner: OT Security Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5434_Assoc12" sourceRef="W5434_Annotation11" targetRef="W5434_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
