    <bpmn:process id="W_W5435" name="W5435. OT Cybersecurity Compliance (IEC 62443 / NIST SP 800-82) &amp; Audit Evidence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual compliance cycle; audit (VS-21.3); customer/partner due-diligence (B2B/VS-107); regulatory expectation
Frequency: Annual self-assessment; per audit/due-diligence
Volume: 1 OT compliance program (IEC 62443-2-1 / 3-3 control set; NIST SP 800-82r3)
Owner: OT Security Lead
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Internal Audit (VS-21), Legal (VS-100), channel owners, external auditor
Source: workflow W5435 — OT Cybersecurity Compliance (IEC 62443 / NIST SP 800-82) &amp; Audit Evidence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5435_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5435_Lane1" name="OT Security Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5435_Lane2" name="OT Security Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5435_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5435_Start4" name="Annual compliance cycle; audit (VS-21.3); customer/partner due-diligence (B2B/VS-107)…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5435_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5435_Task5" name="Map the OT security program (W5417–W5434) to a recognized control framework —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Map the OT security program (W5417–W5434) to a recognized control framework — IEC 62443 (SL selection per zone) and NIST SP 800-82r3 — and identify gaps.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5435_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5435_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5435_Task6" name="Maintain evidence (asset inventory, segmentation, baselines, vuln mgmt, IR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain evidence (asset inventory, segmentation, baselines, vuln mgmt, IR drills, access records) audit-ready in Oracle Internal Controls Manager (ICM — fit-gap H11).
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5435_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5435_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5435_Task7" name="Support internal audit&#x27;s OT-cyber review (VS-21.3) and any BSP cyber-resilience…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Support internal audit&#x27;s OT-cyber review (VS-21.3) and any BSP cyber-resilience / payment-infrastructure expectation (VS-80/VS-142).
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit
Duration: per audit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5435_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5435_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5435_Task8" name="Respond to B2B/customer (VS-107) and insurer (VS-26) due-diligence…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Respond to B2B/customer (VS-107) and insurer (VS-26) due-diligence questionnaires on OT posture without over-disclosing sensitive architecture.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per request</bpmn:documentation>
