      <bpmn:userTask id="W5436_Task6" name="Scope the test with explicit safety constraints — non-prod OT range (W5429) for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Scope the test with explicit safety constraints — non-prod OT range (W5429) for technical exploitation; production limited to non-intrusive validation, with HSE sign-off on anything touching a safety system.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead / HSE
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5436_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5436_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5436_Task7" name="Execute (external firm): IT→OT pivot attempts, OT-IDS evasion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute (external firm): IT→OT pivot attempts, OT-IDS evasion, controller/default-credential checks, payment-zone (POS/SCO) testing, cyber-physical (does a compromise open a locked door or suppress an alarm).
Responsible (R): External Pen-Tester
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per test</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5436_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5436_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
