        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Validate findings exploitability in BuildRight context and route to vuln mgmt (W5427); never auto-trust scanner output on OT.
Responsible (R): OT Vulnerability Manager
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5436_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5436_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
