        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define fail-secure operating modes per OT class: POS/SCO offline mode (continue selling, VS-08 NFR-013), BMS manual-override, fire-system fail-safe-to-alarm, SCADA local-control fallback, EV/locker offline grace.
