    <bpmn:process id="W_W5439" name="W5439. Connected-Channel (POS/SCO/EV/Locker/BMS) Cyber Coordination &amp; Incident Liaison" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Channel-specific cyber event; recurring coordination; new channel onboarding (W5421)
Frequency: Monthly coordination forum; per incident
Volume: ~8–10 connected-device channels (POS/SCO/RF/locker/EV/BMS/SCADA/fire/access/weighbridge)
Owner: OT Security Lead
Participants: VS-08/VS-149 (POS/SCO), VS-164 (lockers), VS-163 (EV), VS-138 (BMS), VS-108 (SCADA), VS-04 (WMS/RF), VS-23 (CCTV/EAS) channel owners
Source: workflow W5439 — Connected-Channel (POS/SCO/EV/Locker/BMS) Cyber Coordination &amp; Incident Liaison</bpmn:documentation>
