      <bpmn:userTask id="W5439_Task7" name="Run a monthly OT-cyber coordination forum across every connected-device channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Run a monthly OT-cyber coordination forum across every connected-device channel — share posture, incidents, advisories, and onboarding pipeline.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5439_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5439_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5439_Task8" name="Maintain a per-channel cyber liaison (named owner in each channel VS) empowered…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain a per-channel cyber liaison (named owner in each channel VS) empowered to act on OT security direction during an incident (W5430).
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: per channel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5439_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5439_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5439_Task9" name="Coordinate cross-channel incidents (e.g., a vendor common to BMS+SCADA+lockers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate cross-channel incidents (e.g., a vendor common to BMS+SCADA+lockers breached simultaneously) with one incident commander and consistent comms.
Responsible (R): OT IR Lead
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5439_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5439_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5439_Task10" name="Align channel-specific security config (POS PIN pad, SCO weight-security…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Align channel-specific security config (POS PIN pad, SCO weight-security, locker access-auth, EV OCPP/OCPI, BMS BACnet) to the OT baseline (W5420).
Responsible (R): OT Security Engineer
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: per channel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5439_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5439_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5439_Task11" name="Feed channel cyber metrics into the posture dashboard (W5424) and channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Feed channel cyber metrics into the posture dashboard (W5424) and channel governance (each channel VS).
Responsible (R): OT Security Analyst
Accountable (A): OT Security Lead
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5439_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5439_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
