        <bpmn:outgoing>W5440_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5440_Task7" name="Assess OT security maturity against a model (IEC 62443 SL / NIST 800-82 /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess OT security maturity against a model (IEC 62443 SL / NIST 800-82 / CMMI-style) and track year-over-year progression.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5440_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5440_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5440_Task8" name="Quantify OT cyber risk in financial terms (loss exposure from a store-closing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quantify OT cyber risk in financial terms (loss exposure from a store-closing POS/BMS outage, a safety-system compromise) for VS-21.2 ERM and VS-26 insurance.
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead / ERM
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5440_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5440_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5440_Task9" name="Build the OT security investment case (tools, staffing, remediation, device…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Build the OT security investment case (tools, staffing, remediation, device replacement) into the technology-business-management plan (VS-135).
Responsible (R): OT Security Lead / TBM
Accountable (A): CIO/CFO
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5440_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5440_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5440_Task10" name="Brief the board/audit committee (VS-36/VS-21) on OT cyber posture, material…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Brief the board/audit committee (VS-36/VS-21) on OT cyber posture, material risks, and investment; align disclosure with VS-173 investor relations where material.
Responsible (R): CIO / OT Security Lead
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5440_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5440_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5440_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5440_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5440_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-802 (ensure controlled execution — OT Compliance, Third-Party Access &amp; Cyber Resilience Analytics (PA-190.3).) | - operational: performance/investment governance on evidence-backed KPIs; OT cyber posture reported to the board/audit committee at least annually.
Owner: OT Security Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
